1
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,319
That's how things stand.

2
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,359
You saw it all yourself.

3
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:54,799
There are only two options.

4
00:01:55,879 --> 00:01:56,200
One.

5
00:01:57,519 --> 00:01:58,560
Take the demolition payout

6
00:01:58,920 --> 00:01:59,280
and cover it.

7
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:01,200
Two.

8
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:03,120
Just like Uncle Ma,

9
00:02:04,439 --> 00:02:04,760
pull out.

10
00:02:06,439 --> 00:02:07,560
You were put in charge of the books,

11
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:10,840
and this is how you ran things?

12
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,240
The books,

13
00:02:18,159 --> 00:02:19,319
you took them over,

14
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,360
so why didn't you manage them?

15
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:26,520
With workers banging on my door,

16
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:29,439
how am I supposed to show my face?

17
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,000
Speak up, all of you.

18
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,400
What do we do now?

19
00:02:38,919 --> 00:02:40,199
What the hell is this?

20
00:02:40,479 --> 00:02:40,840
Dad,

21
00:02:41,719 --> 00:02:42,400
we have to cover it.

22
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,280
Let's just pull out.

23
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:47,280
Dad,

24
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:50,400
the doctor said occasional incontinence is normal.

25
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,439
You need to wear a pad.

26
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:56,000
What are you guys talking about?

27
00:02:57,199 --> 00:02:58,879
Dad, we have to cover this money.

28
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:00,919
I'm not covering it!

29
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:13,960
My pho—

30
00:03:16,039 --> 00:03:16,800
My phone.

31
00:03:36,039 --> 00:03:36,479
Hello.

32
00:03:36,879 --> 00:03:37,680
You're awake.

33
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,879
I was planning to visit you tomorrow.

34
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:41,719
Don't worry.

35
00:03:42,479 --> 00:03:43,479
I'm not going to die.

36
00:03:43,719 --> 00:03:44,439
The site...

37
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:45,919
you saw it, right?

38
00:03:46,879 --> 00:03:47,520
Yeah, I saw it.

39
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,879
Pretty ruthless.

40
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:52,560
He's really out to crush us.

41
00:03:53,319 --> 00:03:53,879
Sai Duoxi.

42
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,560
He's got us right where he wants us.

43
00:03:57,199 --> 00:03:57,840
Let's just give in.

44
00:03:58,199 --> 00:03:59,120
We can't fight this.

45
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:00,360
Wei,

46
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,319
you...

47
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,000
set up a meeting with him.

48
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,039
What?

49
00:04:06,599 --> 00:04:07,439
Meet Shi Yongnian?

50
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,840
You still want to go head-to-head with him?

51
00:04:09,639 --> 00:04:11,759
He's a big boss, and what are we?

52
00:04:11,759 --> 00:04:12,719
Forget all that.

53
00:04:13,159 --> 00:04:14,240
Just get him to meet.

54
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,800
Right at the construction site.

55
00:04:16,439 --> 00:04:17,560
We'll talk to him,

56
00:04:18,079 --> 00:04:19,800
face-to-face.

57
00:04:21,879 --> 00:04:22,199
All right.

58
00:04:22,879 --> 00:04:23,360
I'll do as you say.

59
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:29,079
Uncle,

60
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,800
um, they're all here.

61
00:06:23,079 --> 00:06:23,759
Everyone's here.

62
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:25,560
Dacheng.

63
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:27,480
Sai Duoxi.

64
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,519
How long has it been?

65
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,040
Almost twenty years now?

66
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,680
I should've visited you in the hospital,

67
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,319
but I just couldn't find the time.

68
00:06:37,759 --> 00:06:39,480
Seeing you both recovering well,

69
00:06:39,959 --> 00:06:40,639
I'm relieved.

70
00:06:42,839 --> 00:06:43,199
Tell me,

71
00:06:44,199 --> 00:06:44,759
all these years,

72
00:06:45,319 --> 00:06:46,000
how have you been?

73
00:06:47,519 --> 00:06:49,120
How we're doing

74
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,360
depends entirely on your whim.

75
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,680
With a wave of your hand,

76
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:54,279
you shut down the whole site.

77
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:56,759
With just a few words,

78
00:06:56,879 --> 00:06:58,120
the three old brothers

79
00:06:58,199 --> 00:06:59,800
had our fate sealed.

80
00:07:00,199 --> 00:07:00,759
Still,

81
00:07:01,279 --> 00:07:02,519
I have to thank you.

82
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,120
You haven't forgotten old times.

83
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:06,319
The moment we reached out,

84
00:07:06,519 --> 00:07:07,160
you showed up.

85
00:07:07,959 --> 00:07:09,319
Asking you here today

86
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,160
is mainly to ask:

87
00:07:12,199 --> 00:07:13,439
what has our work

88
00:07:13,839 --> 00:07:15,319
done to upset you?

89
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,319
Minor checks every three days,

90
00:07:17,399 --> 00:07:18,639
major inspections every five days.

91
00:07:18,839 --> 00:07:19,959
After the company inspects,

92
00:07:19,959 --> 00:07:20,519
the group inspects.

93
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,040
After the group inspects,

94
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:24,120
the new supervisors inspect again.

95
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:26,360
What is it about the three old brothers

96
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:28,079
that gets on your nerves?

97
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:30,519
Do you have to tear us apart

98
00:07:30,519 --> 00:07:31,399
and drive us to death

99
00:07:31,639 --> 00:07:32,240
before you'll stop?

100
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,160
Sai Duoxi,

101
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,560
that's not fair to say.

102
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,959
I've never targeted you guys.

103
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:41,680
Safety and lives come first on a project.

104
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:44,040
I have to be responsible for this construction.

105
00:07:44,399 --> 00:07:45,040
Huzi,

106
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:48,480
we both know damn well

107
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:50,920
that you're gunning for me.

108
00:08:00,279 --> 00:08:00,720
Sai Duoxi,

109
00:08:02,399 --> 00:08:03,639
out of respect for our history,

110
00:08:04,519 --> 00:08:05,639
I still call you "brother."

111
00:08:06,199 --> 00:08:07,399
Times have changed.

112
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:09,879
Back then, you could run a 30-man crew,

113
00:08:10,319 --> 00:08:11,399
even 60 was no problem.

114
00:08:12,319 --> 00:08:13,480
Can you handle 300?

115
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,720
For any ordinary Tengyue project,

116
00:08:15,959 --> 00:08:16,959
at peak construction,

117
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,720
there are 2,400 people on site.

118
00:08:18,839 --> 00:08:20,360
Even putting the three old brothers together,

119
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:22,519
could you manage 2,400 people?

120
00:08:24,279 --> 00:08:25,000
I'll say it again:

121
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,319
whatever can be let go,

122
00:08:26,879 --> 00:08:27,720
I'll let go.

123
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:29,759
But what can't be forgiven

124
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:33,679
never will be.

125
00:08:34,279 --> 00:08:35,639
Cut the crap.

126
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,200
Give me a straight answer.

127
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:40,000
The Phase 3 payment—

128
00:08:40,639 --> 00:08:41,360
are you paying or not?

129
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:44,399
Zhou,

130
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:45,440
the check.

131
00:08:56,039 --> 00:08:56,639
Dacheng.

132
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:58,679
Here's 20,000.

133
00:08:59,039 --> 00:08:59,639
Take it for now.

134
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,080
Your Phase 3 payment

135
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,759
will be sent to Changfu Construction shortly.

136
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,720
N-No, thank—thank you, Huzi.

137
00:09:07,039 --> 00:09:08,399
N-No, thank—thank you, Mr. Shi.

138
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:09,960
You've already pulled out,

139
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,279
so we can't let you lose out.

140
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:13,720
The company added ten percent to this 20,000

141
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:14,600
as compensation.

142
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:15,879
I stand by what I've always said:

143
00:09:16,279 --> 00:09:17,200
business is business,

144
00:09:17,679 --> 00:09:18,639
and personal feelings are another matter.

145
00:09:19,559 --> 00:09:20,960
If you ever run into trouble down the road,

146
00:09:21,279 --> 00:09:21,600
come find me.

147
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:23,960
Take good care of your health.

148
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:25,759
Thank you.

149
00:09:27,639 --> 00:09:28,120
Wei,

150
00:09:28,559 --> 00:09:29,519
as for the Sai family's site,

151
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:30,639
it's very simple.

152
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,679
Once everything on this site

153
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,159
is fully settled and squared away,

154
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,519
the Phase 3 payment will be released to you at once.

155
00:09:37,679 --> 00:09:38,320
Fine then.

156
00:09:39,039 --> 00:09:41,399
Then we'll just keep the site shut down.

157
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:42,919
Qingyou,

158
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,480
tell everyone:

159
00:09:44,799 --> 00:09:46,240
I don't have the money to front,

160
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,320
and it's not my job to front it anyway.

161
00:09:48,399 --> 00:09:48,679
Right!

162
00:09:48,879 --> 00:09:51,480
Tengyue owes this money to Changfu,

163
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,559
and Changfu owes it to us.

164
00:09:52,559 --> 00:09:52,799
Right!

165
00:09:53,279 --> 00:09:53,519
Exactly!

166
00:09:53,519 --> 00:09:54,159
So right now,

167
00:09:54,759 --> 00:09:56,480
it's Changfu that owes us money.

168
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:56,840
That's right!

169
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:57,679
Wait,

170
00:09:58,039 --> 00:09:58,480
Sai Duoxi...

171
00:09:58,879 --> 00:10:00,159
Wh-What do you mean by this?

172
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:03,279
All my contracts were signed with Changfu.

173
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,519
Now that Changfu owes me money,

174
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,919
I guess we'll just see each other in court.

175
00:10:10,279 --> 00:10:11,519
Y-You're really going to sue me?

176
00:10:12,639 --> 00:10:14,080
Isn't it completely clear by now?

177
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:17,000
Changfu owes me the Phase 3 payment,

178
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,799
so I have no choice but to sue you.

179
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,600
As for whether

180
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,200
this whole mess

181
00:10:22,679 --> 00:10:23,279
drags you down,

182
00:10:23,879 --> 00:10:24,799
that's none of my concern.

183
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,080
If you want to sue,

184
00:10:26,559 --> 00:10:27,120
sue Tengyue.

185
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:29,080
That has nothing to do with me either.

186
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:30,639
Since things have come to this,

187
00:10:30,879 --> 00:10:33,039
deadlines,

188
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:35,039
quality, handover...

189
00:10:35,039 --> 00:10:36,200
there's no point even talking about them.

190
00:10:36,279 --> 00:10:36,600
Just let it stall.

191
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:37,320
Then we'll stall.

192
00:10:37,399 --> 00:10:37,639
Right!

193
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:38,840
Besides,

194
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,759
I, Sai Duoxi,

195
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:42,440
am a Honggang local.

196
00:10:42,759 --> 00:10:43,679
My home is right here.

197
00:10:44,159 --> 00:10:44,919
I'm not moving,

198
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:45,879
and I'm not leaving.

199
00:10:46,159 --> 00:10:47,559
I'll lead all our guys

200
00:10:47,559 --> 00:10:48,480
to demand our unpaid wages together.

201
00:10:48,919 --> 00:10:50,960
Until the court issues a verdict,

202
00:10:51,519 --> 00:10:52,639
first trial, second trial...

203
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:53,799
we'll keep making noise like this.

204
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,440
I just want to see,

205
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:56,759
whether it's Changfu,

206
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:57,840
or Tengyue,

207
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:58,840
or my construction team

208
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:01,240
that's about to be forced out,

209
00:11:01,639 --> 00:11:03,240
who can hold out the longest!

210
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:08,679
Sai Duoxi,

211
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,600
after all these years,

212
00:11:10,879 --> 00:11:12,759
your mind is still sharp as ever.

213
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:13,799
I'm impressed.

214
00:11:14,679 --> 00:11:15,600
You really want to sue?

215
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:17,320
Fine by me.

216
00:11:19,039 --> 00:11:19,600
Lawyer Sai,

217
00:11:23,919 --> 00:11:24,879
pull out that contract

218
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:26,480
and review it carefully.

219
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:28,120
If Changfu really sues us,

220
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:29,639
will the liable third party

221
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:31,360
be Duoxi's construction team?

222
00:11:31,879 --> 00:11:32,399
Get everything ready.

223
00:11:34,559 --> 00:11:36,720
You really think I'm joking with you?

224
00:11:38,039 --> 00:11:38,399
Lawyer,

225
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:39,840
bring it over.

226
00:11:43,639 --> 00:11:44,080
Wei,

227
00:11:44,879 --> 00:11:45,799
here's the legal notice.

228
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:47,559
Take it.

229
00:11:48,159 --> 00:11:49,879
Just wait for your court summons.

230
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:51,240
Come on, Sai Duoxi,

231
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:53,600
do... do you really have to do this?

232
00:11:58,320 --> 00:11:58,759
Mr. Shi,

233
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:00,200
you heard that too.

234
00:12:00,519 --> 00:12:02,240
If these chain lawsuits get started,

235
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:04,000
this site will just be left to rot.

236
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:05,279
If it comes to that,

237
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:07,480
how will you answer to Shenzhen headquarters?

238
00:12:07,679 --> 00:12:07,960
Right?

239
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:09,360
As for the smart port project,

240
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:10,480
will it ever get finished?

241
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:11,320
Of course,

242
00:12:11,519 --> 00:12:13,080
that's none of my concern.

243
00:12:13,639 --> 00:12:14,159
Either way,

244
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,440
if he sues me,

245
00:12:15,759 --> 00:12:16,759
I'm definitely suing you.

246
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:19,000
If it isn't settled in a year, make it two.

247
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,240
If two years aren't enough, make it three.

248
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:21,240
We'll just drag this out.

249
00:12:21,559 --> 00:12:22,240
And in the end,

250
00:12:22,399 --> 00:12:23,840
if this becomes an abandoned project,

251
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:25,399
neither of us can blame the other.

252
00:12:51,279 --> 00:12:51,799
Zhou,

253
00:12:52,279 --> 00:12:52,559
here's the deal.

254
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:55,720
Disburse 50% of the Phase 3 payment.

255
00:12:55,919 --> 00:12:56,720
That's not enough.

256
00:12:57,759 --> 00:12:58,360
Half?

257
00:12:58,360 --> 00:12:59,679
How is the site supposed to start work?

258
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,080
I honestly thought

259
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:10,559
today was a reunion of old friends.

260
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:13,840
I didn't expect it to turn out like this.

261
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:15,320
Mr. Wei,

262
00:13:15,519 --> 00:13:17,279
you either take this 50%

263
00:13:17,279 --> 00:13:18,080
and get to work immediately,

264
00:13:18,159 --> 00:13:19,480
or dig in your heels against me

265
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:20,440
and we'll see each other in court.

266
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:21,519
It's your choice.

267
00:13:40,559 --> 00:13:41,039
Sai Duoxi,

268
00:13:42,519 --> 00:13:43,639
tell me the honest truth.

269
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,080
If today

270
00:13:46,919 --> 00:13:48,480
Shi Yongnian had refused to release the funds,

271
00:13:49,159 --> 00:13:49,559
what then?

272
00:13:49,759 --> 00:13:51,080
Would you really have sued me in court?

273
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:55,200
That was just an empty threat.

274
00:13:55,799 --> 00:13:57,399
A tactical bluff.

275
00:13:57,399 --> 00:13:59,080
See? Didn't the money come through?

276
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:00,120
A tactical bluff?

277
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:01,679
You could've given me a heads-up beforehand,

278
00:14:01,679 --> 00:14:02,080
couldn't you?

279
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,440
Even just a glance!

280
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:04,919
You made me look like a fool today.

281
00:14:04,919 --> 00:14:05,840
If I'd tipped you off,

282
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:06,960
would it still work as a tactic?

283
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,240
That's what made it look real!

284
00:14:09,279 --> 00:14:10,440
The way you operate these days,

285
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:11,679
it makes me increasingly uneasy.

286
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,080
Just to get the money back,

287
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:14,799
it seems to me

288
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:16,279
there's nothing you wouldn't do.

289
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:19,440
Wei, what's that supposed to mean?

290
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:22,320
You advanced the Phase 3 payment to Ma,

291
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:24,320
so wasn't your own company strapped for cash?

292
00:14:24,399 --> 00:14:25,919
Now that I've gotten the money back,

293
00:14:26,159 --> 00:14:27,600
didn't it solve your pressing emergency too?

294
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:28,759
Beating around the bush like this,

295
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:30,279
turns out you're just blaming me

296
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:31,679
for not fronting money to the Sai family,

297
00:14:31,679 --> 00:14:32,120
aren't you?

298
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:34,320
Don't take this the wrong way, Wei,

299
00:14:34,559 --> 00:14:35,919
but why are you sometimes

300
00:14:35,919 --> 00:14:37,120
so petty?

301
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:38,799
Obsessing over the pettiest things.

302
00:14:38,799 --> 00:14:39,799
I'm petty?

303
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,799
When you pressed Shi Yongnian just now,

304
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:42,720
dragging Changfu into it

305
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:43,720
just to use as a pawn,

306
00:14:43,799 --> 00:14:44,440
what do you call that?

307
00:14:44,679 --> 00:14:45,720
We're about to join forces,

308
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:46,720
and you pull this stunt on me?

309
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:48,399
Don't think I can't see it.

310
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:49,840
This idea of selling your company,

311
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:50,600
you never gave it up.

312
00:14:50,679 --> 00:14:51,840
If I had told you,

313
00:14:52,039 --> 00:14:53,360
would you have blabbed to Shi Yongnian?

314
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,679
Would we have gotten the money then?

315
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:02,679
A deal worth tens of millions—

316
00:15:03,759 --> 00:15:05,000
who wouldn't be tempted?

317
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:08,919
If

318
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:11,879
Ma and I hadn't flanked you

319
00:15:12,799 --> 00:15:14,360
and painstakingly talked you round,

320
00:15:15,279 --> 00:15:16,480
when it comes to this merger,

321
00:15:17,639 --> 00:15:19,960
you'd be against it a hundred times over.

322
00:15:40,840 --> 00:15:41,240
Sai Duoxi,

323
00:15:42,039 --> 00:15:44,080
if you don't even trust your old brothers,

324
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:46,080
then partnering up down the road...

325
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:47,240
what's really the point anymore?

326
00:15:48,519 --> 00:15:49,600
What do you mean by that?

327
00:15:50,759 --> 00:15:52,799
Just because I didn't give you a heads-up?

328
00:15:52,799 --> 00:15:53,200
Is that it?

329
00:15:53,399 --> 00:15:54,480
You think it's just about that?

330
00:15:56,559 --> 00:15:56,960
Forget it.

331
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:00,639
In the end,

332
00:16:00,639 --> 00:16:01,840
everyone's only looking out for themselves.

333
00:16:02,039 --> 00:16:03,159
Think whatever you want.

334
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:04,559
As for me,

335
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:06,039
I'm still selling the company.

336
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,000
A clean break,

337
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:08,240
so nobody owes anyone anything.

338
00:16:08,679 --> 00:16:09,240
Fine.

339
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:11,200
The company is yours.

340
00:16:11,799 --> 00:16:12,799
Do whatever you want with it.

341
00:16:13,399 --> 00:16:14,600
After all that turmoil,

342
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:16,519
the money was secured,

343
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:19,159
but the old brothers had fallen apart.

344
00:16:21,159 --> 00:16:22,000
Was anyone to blame?

345
00:16:22,759 --> 00:16:23,480
No.

346
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:25,279
Yet bringing them all together,

347
00:16:25,279 --> 00:16:26,759
this was how it turned out.

348
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:29,559
Sai Duoxi's wound ached,

349
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:31,559
and so did his heart.

350
00:16:43,679 --> 00:16:44,039
Come in.

351
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,000
Mr. Shi,

352
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:47,879
about Changfu Group's first Phase 3 payment,

353
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:49,000
we still need your signature.

354
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:49,879
Like hell I'm signing!

355
00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:51,720
If it's not a good time,

356
00:16:51,879 --> 00:16:52,480
I can come back later.

357
00:16:52,559 --> 00:16:53,600
Who said it's not a good time?

358
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:54,879
Put it there.

359
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:01,360
Already agreed in front of all those people.

360
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:03,399
What's the point of dragging it out?

361
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:05,759
Take it.

362
00:17:23,039 --> 00:17:23,799
Wei Changfu.

363
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:25,039
Hello, President Shi.

364
00:17:25,279 --> 00:17:26,200
That plan of yours...

365
00:17:26,319 --> 00:17:28,799
to acquire Changfu Construction,

366
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:31,279
it's not canceled, is it?

367
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:34,920
Of course not.

368
00:17:35,839 --> 00:17:37,279
My acquisition offer is still on the table.

369
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:39,559
Then let's talk again.

370
00:17:40,359 --> 00:17:40,759
In person.

371
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,039
All right, sounds good.

372
00:18:17,039 --> 00:18:18,480
Let's just rent the equipment for now.

373
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:19,839
Renting is cheaper than buying.

374
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:21,759
Insisting on buying all new gear—

375
00:18:21,759 --> 00:18:22,640
how could we afford that?

376
00:18:23,480 --> 00:18:24,039
See that?

377
00:18:24,319 --> 00:18:25,279
What did I tell you?

378
00:18:26,039 --> 00:18:27,400
Rented stuff just doesn't work well!

379
00:18:27,599 --> 00:18:29,279
It breaks down every other day!

380
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:30,440
Can't you just swap it for another one?

381
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:31,720
What do you mean "just swap it"?

382
00:18:31,839 --> 00:18:32,440
It delays our schedule!

383
00:18:32,440 --> 00:18:33,160
Will you take the blame?

384
00:18:33,359 --> 00:18:33,920
What did I tell you?

385
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:34,759
Didn't I say we need to buy new ones?

386
00:18:34,799 --> 00:18:35,680
Otherwise, how are we supposed to work?

387
00:18:35,839 --> 00:18:36,319
You tell me!

388
00:18:36,359 --> 00:18:37,359
Replace them all with new ones!

389
00:18:37,759 --> 00:18:38,799
Qingyou, go attend to your work.

390
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:41,319
Come on, talk to her nicely.

391
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:42,039
Let me tell you,

392
00:18:42,519 --> 00:18:43,160
put it on the agenda.

393
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:43,680
You hear me?

394
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:45,400
I... I got it. I got it.

395
00:18:46,759 --> 00:18:47,759
As for buying equipment,

396
00:18:47,759 --> 00:18:48,720
we can't right now.

397
00:18:49,079 --> 00:18:50,039
There's barely any money in the account.

398
00:18:50,039 --> 00:18:51,000
That money is our lifeline.

399
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:52,480
That's for emergencies.

400
00:18:53,759 --> 00:18:55,960
Women are always so short-sighted.

401
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:57,880
Renting trucks from the Weis—

402
00:18:58,000 --> 00:18:58,960
not only is the rent high,

403
00:18:59,079 --> 00:19:00,160
we also have to suck up to them.

404
00:19:00,480 --> 00:19:01,480
Right now our site has no equipment,

405
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:02,559
so we have no leverage.

406
00:19:02,559 --> 00:19:03,119
You know that?

407
00:19:03,279 --> 00:19:03,799
This construction site,

408
00:19:04,279 --> 00:19:05,200
how many days has it been shut down?

409
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:07,960
Our schedule is tight, the workload heavy.

410
00:19:08,119 --> 00:19:09,000
Without our own gear,

411
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:11,039
we'll always be at their mercy!

412
00:19:11,319 --> 00:19:13,039
If you really don't want Changfu's equipment,

413
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:14,400
don't the Mas have some too?

414
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:15,799
Their prices are negotiable.

415
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:17,039
Look at you...

416
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:20,400
How old is the Mas' gear?

417
00:19:20,480 --> 00:19:21,839
It's outdated junk.

418
00:19:21,960 --> 00:19:23,039
If we use their stuff,

419
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:25,279
repairs will cost more than the rent!

420
00:19:25,319 --> 00:19:25,880
You... you...

421
00:19:26,400 --> 00:19:28,720
You spend all day cooking by the stove!

422
00:19:29,039 --> 00:19:31,240
What do you know about sc-scale production?

423
00:19:31,319 --> 00:19:32,559
What do you know about long-term investment?

424
00:19:32,559 --> 00:19:33,240
I don't know?

425
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:34,079
I don't know?!

426
00:19:34,079 --> 00:19:35,799
Who got the ledger back from your Second Brother?

427
00:19:36,279 --> 00:19:37,240
The funds finally came through,

428
00:19:37,480 --> 00:19:39,119
but half of the Phase 3 payment is missing!

429
00:19:39,119 --> 00:19:40,400
Once we pay the workers their wages,

430
00:19:40,599 --> 00:19:41,680
how much will be left in the account?

431
00:19:42,079 --> 00:19:43,599
Playing the big shot and buying gear now...

432
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:45,079
What if our funds dry up again?

433
00:19:45,599 --> 00:19:46,960
Can you go beg Shi Yongnian,

434
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:48,440
or make Dad pick another fight with him?

435
00:19:48,599 --> 00:19:50,079
Don't you have any common sense?

436
00:19:51,759 --> 00:19:52,759
I swear, you...

437
00:19:53,039 --> 00:19:53,960
Can't you stand to see me

438
00:19:53,960 --> 00:19:54,920
accomplish anything?

439
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:55,759
As for today,

440
00:19:55,839 --> 00:19:56,599
I'm calling the shots!

441
00:19:56,799 --> 00:19:57,200
This equipment,

442
00:19:57,200 --> 00:19:58,039
I'm definitely buying it!

443
00:19:58,039 --> 00:19:59,400
Nobody can stop me!

444
00:19:59,400 --> 00:20:00,559
Oh, you think you're so capable!

445
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:01,759
If you dig yourself into another hole,

446
00:20:01,759 --> 00:20:02,279
let me tell you,

447
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:03,599
don't expect me to bail you out!

448
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:05,200
Look at you acting all high and mighty!

449
00:20:07,480 --> 00:20:09,039
Short-sighted and narrow-minded.

450
00:20:27,880 --> 00:20:28,240
Sister-in-law,

451
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:30,599
now that you've stepped in,

452
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:31,880
Mingming's listening now, isn't he?

453
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:32,720
He backed down, right?

454
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:34,000
With that stubborn temper of his...

455
00:20:35,640 --> 00:20:36,799
Qingyou, at a time like this,

456
00:20:37,079 --> 00:20:37,839
let's not butt heads with him.

457
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:39,000
Save him some face.

458
00:20:39,279 --> 00:20:40,160
Just tell him

459
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:42,920
the equipment model he wants is out of stock.

460
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:44,079
It's too late for that.

461
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:46,359
He knows which factory I'm buying from.

462
00:20:46,559 --> 00:20:47,640
It's a reputable, major plant.

463
00:20:48,039 --> 00:20:49,160
One phone call and we're busted.

464
00:20:51,119 --> 00:20:52,400
Then say the price isn't right.

465
00:20:52,759 --> 00:20:53,240
It's too expensive.

466
00:20:53,480 --> 00:20:53,920
We need to compare prices.

467
00:20:54,119 --> 00:20:55,119
Well, he knows that

468
00:20:55,119 --> 00:20:56,319
I've already negotiated it down to rock bottom.

469
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:58,000
In all of Honggang,

470
00:20:58,000 --> 00:20:59,720
there's nowhere cheaper than them.

471
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:01,000
Seriously? This won't work, that won't work...

472
00:21:01,119 --> 00:21:01,599
Yang Qingyou,

473
00:21:01,839 --> 00:21:02,480
are you the accountant,

474
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,200
or just a messenger boy?

475
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:04,640
How much money is left in the books?

476
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:05,759
Don't you have any clue?

477
00:21:05,759 --> 00:21:06,319
Of course I do!

478
00:21:06,319 --> 00:21:07,079
He's being hot-headed right now,

479
00:21:07,079 --> 00:21:07,960
and you're acting just as reckless!

480
00:21:08,119 --> 00:21:09,039
That's why I'm telling—telling you to go!

481
00:21:09,039 --> 00:21:10,119
Figure out a way yourself!

482
00:21:10,119 --> 00:21:10,640
But I...

483
00:21:10,680 --> 00:21:11,559
You're completely useless!

484
00:21:11,799 --> 00:21:12,599
Then just quit!

485
00:21:12,599 --> 00:21:13,759
What are you even doing?

486
00:21:17,119 --> 00:21:17,920
Nobody do anything then!

487
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:20,319
What the hell is going on?

488
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:28,400
Master Zhou.

489
00:21:28,599 --> 00:21:30,319
Aren't you cold wearing so little?

490
00:21:30,440 --> 00:21:31,519
Looking good is what matters most.

491
00:21:33,559 --> 00:21:35,119
In an out-of-the-way place like this,

492
00:21:35,119 --> 00:21:35,920
can you even find it?

493
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:37,400
Look, look here.

494
00:21:37,559 --> 00:21:38,319
Isn't this great?

495
00:21:39,119 --> 00:21:40,039
It's all ours.

496
00:21:40,119 --> 00:21:40,680
Not this.

497
00:21:40,920 --> 00:21:41,559
This belongs to someone else.

498
00:21:41,559 --> 00:21:42,400
They have to take it with them.

499
00:21:43,359 --> 00:21:44,519
We'll have our own in the future.

500
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:45,480
This... this is the warehouse.

501
00:21:45,720 --> 00:21:46,000
Look.

502
00:21:46,359 --> 00:21:47,400
Come, come this way.

503
00:21:49,720 --> 00:21:50,319
Here, right here.

504
00:21:50,319 --> 00:21:50,960
Can't find it.

505
00:21:51,519 --> 00:21:51,920
Let me tell you,

506
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:53,200
this terrace is all ours.

507
00:21:53,759 --> 00:21:55,599
Sister Feng, we're here, Sister Feng!

508
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:57,359
Did you bring the money?

509
00:21:57,599 --> 00:21:58,319
Not just the money.

510
00:21:58,319 --> 00:21:59,279
I brought the contract too.

511
00:21:59,279 --> 00:22:00,559
You have to hand over the shop to me today.

512
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:01,039
Really?

513
00:22:01,200 --> 00:22:01,960
Who's this?

514
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:02,839
She's so pretty!

515
00:22:02,839 --> 00:22:04,119
My sister-in-law, Sai Qianjin.

516
00:22:04,119 --> 00:22:05,079
Qianjin, greet Sister Feng.

517
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:05,799
Hello, Sister Feng.

518
00:22:05,799 --> 00:22:06,079
Come on in.

519
00:22:06,079 --> 00:22:06,519
Hello, hello.

520
00:22:06,519 --> 00:22:07,200
Come, come in.

521
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:11,000
Sister Feng,

522
00:22:11,480 --> 00:22:12,759
the money and contract are all here.

523
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:13,720
Take a close look.

524
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:14,880
Count the money carefully too.

525
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:16,680
I'll show my sister-in-law around.

526
00:22:17,119 --> 00:22:17,400
Sure.

527
00:22:17,640 --> 00:22:17,920
Come on.

528
00:22:19,279 --> 00:22:21,319
Xiaojing, slacking off again?

529
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:23,119
My eyes are so sore.

530
00:22:23,119 --> 00:22:23,720
I know.

531
00:22:23,720 --> 00:22:25,119
This work really strains the eyes.

532
00:22:25,319 --> 00:22:27,160
But this yields the best results.

533
00:22:27,720 --> 00:22:29,440
Whether a wedding dress looks gorgeous

534
00:22:29,440 --> 00:22:30,960
all comes down to these details.

535
00:22:31,440 --> 00:22:32,480
See, these are ice beads.

536
00:22:32,640 --> 00:22:33,880
Over there, they're sewing lace.

537
00:22:34,839 --> 00:22:35,279
Qianjin,

538
00:22:35,920 --> 00:22:37,440
this is called a lockstitch sewing machine.

539
00:22:38,200 --> 00:22:40,400
Don't let the aged look fool you.

540
00:22:40,799 --> 00:22:41,279
Even so,

541
00:22:41,880 --> 00:22:43,519
Sister Feng, back then,

542
00:22:43,599 --> 00:22:44,880
spent a fortune to buy it.

543
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:46,039
Over here is the ironing area.

544
00:22:46,119 --> 00:22:48,440
Once the gown is done, a quick steam fixes it up.

545
00:22:48,960 --> 00:22:51,240
This is where we measure and cut fabric.

546
00:22:51,519 --> 00:22:52,920
Once an order comes in,

547
00:22:53,119 --> 00:22:54,279
we first take the measurements.

548
00:22:54,559 --> 00:22:55,119
And then,

549
00:22:55,400 --> 00:22:55,960
right here,

550
00:22:57,559 --> 00:22:58,279
this is called unbleached muslin,

551
00:22:58,480 --> 00:23:00,000
we sketch out a rough outline on it.

552
00:23:00,359 --> 00:23:02,319
Then we go through each step one by one.

553
00:23:03,039 --> 00:23:03,480
Sister-in-law,

554
00:23:04,160 --> 00:23:05,079
here's what I'm thinking.

555
00:23:05,559 --> 00:23:07,279
Even close sisters need clear accounts.

556
00:23:07,440 --> 00:23:08,599
Besides, inside and out,

557
00:23:08,599 --> 00:23:09,640
everything relies on you running things.

558
00:23:09,839 --> 00:23:10,400
I don't know the trade,

559
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:11,839
so I can only assist you.

560
00:23:12,240 --> 00:23:13,200
Once we turn a profit,

561
00:23:13,599 --> 00:23:14,400
we'll split it forty-sixty.

562
00:23:18,319 --> 00:23:20,000
Sixty for you, forty for me.

563
00:23:21,359 --> 00:23:21,880
Qianjin,

564
00:23:22,440 --> 00:23:23,839
that's not what I meant.

565
00:23:24,440 --> 00:23:25,279
I just thought...

566
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:26,440
even if I...

567
00:23:27,240 --> 00:23:28,279
I get 51 percent,

568
00:23:28,480 --> 00:23:29,559
just a tiny bit more,

569
00:23:30,119 --> 00:23:31,279
I just want to call the shots.

570
00:23:31,279 --> 00:23:31,960
All right.

571
00:23:32,319 --> 00:23:32,839
Thirty-seventy.

572
00:23:33,240 --> 00:23:33,720
No, don't.

573
00:23:36,480 --> 00:23:37,119
Forty-sixty then.

574
00:23:38,680 --> 00:23:39,519
Once we make money,

575
00:23:40,079 --> 00:23:41,640
I'll pay your share back first,

576
00:23:41,880 --> 00:23:42,880
principal and interest included.

577
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:43,440
Qianjin,

578
00:23:44,240 --> 00:23:44,799
don't worry.

579
00:23:45,119 --> 00:23:46,000
Stick with me,

580
00:23:46,559 --> 00:23:47,319
and we'll strike it rich.

581
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:48,039
Jiayin!

582
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:49,000
Coming!

583
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:50,160
Are we signing this contract or not?

584
00:23:50,240 --> 00:23:50,880
Coming!

585
00:23:53,400 --> 00:23:53,680
Come on.

586
00:23:54,759 --> 00:23:56,079
Hurry up, I've already signed.

587
00:23:56,440 --> 00:23:56,920
That's great.

588
00:23:57,119 --> 00:23:57,400
Here.

589
00:24:01,359 --> 00:24:02,839
Moving on to our final agenda item.

590
00:24:03,920 --> 00:24:05,279
First, I'd like to announce some good news.

591
00:24:06,000 --> 00:24:07,079
After tough negotiations,

592
00:24:07,240 --> 00:24:08,079
Changfu Construction

593
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:09,759
has finally agreed to our acquisition plan.

594
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:12,079
They finally agreed.

595
00:24:15,559 --> 00:24:17,559
Now, let's invite Mr. Shi to give further instructions.

596
00:24:19,359 --> 00:24:20,200
It was a tough nut to crack,

597
00:24:20,359 --> 00:24:21,160
but we finally pulled it off.

598
00:24:21,599 --> 00:24:22,359
Congratulations, everyone.

599
00:24:23,160 --> 00:24:23,799
Next,

600
00:24:24,079 --> 00:24:25,640
we must set up a dedicated task force

601
00:24:26,400 --> 00:24:27,039
to conduct a

602
00:24:27,599 --> 00:24:29,000
comprehensive audit

603
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:29,920
and liquidation of Changfu.

604
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:31,279
The findings you come up with

605
00:24:31,400 --> 00:24:34,119
will directly determine Changfu's final acquisition price.

606
00:24:34,640 --> 00:24:35,200
As for Changfu,

607
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:38,400
every fund, transaction record, and related contract

608
00:24:38,960 --> 00:24:39,759
must be thoroughly examined.

609
00:24:40,160 --> 00:24:40,920
Every single penny,

610
00:24:41,440 --> 00:24:42,160
how it came in

611
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:43,720
and how it was spent,

612
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:45,400
must be completely accounted for.

613
00:24:45,640 --> 00:24:46,160
Zhou,

614
00:24:47,680 --> 00:24:49,119
let's have you take the lead on this.

615
00:24:49,720 --> 00:24:50,640
Assemble a sharp team

616
00:24:50,920 --> 00:24:52,000
and dig deep into it.

617
00:24:52,759 --> 00:24:53,359
Understood, Mr. Shi.

618
00:24:53,720 --> 00:24:54,559
On the legal side,

619
00:24:55,039 --> 00:24:56,000
Lawyer Sai will remain in charge.

620
00:24:56,880 --> 00:24:57,920
If you're short-handed,

621
00:24:58,079 --> 00:24:58,799
pull staff from other departments.

622
00:24:58,960 --> 00:24:59,640
Bottom line,

623
00:24:59,799 --> 00:25:00,480
we'll give you our full support.

624
00:25:01,240 --> 00:25:01,559
All right.

625
00:25:02,039 --> 00:25:03,160
One last point I must emphasize:

626
00:25:04,519 --> 00:25:07,359
the construction teams of Sai Duoxi and Ma Jiucheng

627
00:25:07,960 --> 00:25:08,880
must serve as your entry point,

628
00:25:09,599 --> 00:25:10,279
as key targets for audit.

629
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:11,759
Check their contract performance,

630
00:25:11,960 --> 00:25:13,000
check their accounts,

631
00:25:13,079 --> 00:25:14,359
and don't let a single detail slip by.

632
00:25:14,799 --> 00:25:15,839
These two construction teams

633
00:25:17,599 --> 00:25:18,960
have had close ties with Changfu

634
00:25:19,680 --> 00:25:20,279
for over a decade.

635
00:25:20,799 --> 00:25:21,640
If there's going to be an issue,

636
00:25:21,880 --> 00:25:22,559
that's where it'll be.

637
00:25:23,759 --> 00:25:24,279
Lawyer Sai.

638
00:25:27,279 --> 00:25:27,799
Lawyer Sai.

639
00:25:29,480 --> 00:25:30,559
This is an arduous task.

640
00:25:31,279 --> 00:25:32,119
Throughout the group,

641
00:25:32,559 --> 00:25:34,079
there are so many eyes watching.

642
00:25:34,519 --> 00:25:35,920
I overruled everyone

643
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:37,799
to hire you at great expense as our legal expert.

644
00:25:38,359 --> 00:25:39,680
I trust your professionalism.

645
00:25:40,680 --> 00:25:41,119
Mr. Shi,

646
00:25:42,200 --> 00:25:43,079
I'm a lawyer.

647
00:25:43,759 --> 00:25:45,960
I'll strictly abide by national laws and regulations,

648
00:25:46,240 --> 00:25:47,160
as well as company rules.

649
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:48,119
Rest assured, Mr. Shi.

650
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:49,240
Good.

651
00:25:50,119 --> 00:25:51,240
Are there any other agenda items?

652
00:25:56,680 --> 00:25:58,000
Look at all these wedding dresses.

653
00:25:58,319 --> 00:25:59,799
They're all from our workshop.

654
00:26:00,119 --> 00:26:00,680
Really?

655
00:26:01,680 --> 00:26:02,240
Really.

656
00:26:02,400 --> 00:26:02,680
Right?

657
00:26:02,680 --> 00:26:03,359
Displayed here like this,

658
00:26:03,359 --> 00:26:04,200
they just look different.

659
00:26:04,200 --> 00:26:05,079
So upscale.

660
00:26:05,079 --> 00:26:05,759
Right?

661
00:26:06,359 --> 00:26:07,519
This one is gorgeous.

662
00:26:08,400 --> 00:26:09,359
Come on.

663
00:26:09,559 --> 00:26:10,880
Let's go say hi to Mr. Peng.

664
00:26:12,079 --> 00:26:12,680
Mr. Peng.

665
00:26:14,160 --> 00:26:15,759
We just came to say goodbye

666
00:26:15,759 --> 00:26:16,680
before heading back.

667
00:26:17,559 --> 00:26:19,559
Brother Peng, please look out for us.

668
00:26:20,279 --> 00:26:21,960
Sister Feng and I go way back.

669
00:26:22,799 --> 00:26:23,559
When it comes to your work,

670
00:26:23,880 --> 00:26:24,359
I have total faith.

671
00:26:24,720 --> 00:26:25,440
I still have guests with me,

672
00:26:26,400 --> 00:26:27,519
so I'll catch up with you later.

673
00:26:28,119 --> 00:26:29,079
Let's keep in touch.

674
00:26:29,640 --> 00:26:30,640
Sure, we won't keep you.

675
00:26:30,920 --> 00:26:31,799
Dinner's on me next time

676
00:26:31,799 --> 00:26:32,759
so I can pick your brain.

677
00:26:32,759 --> 00:26:33,319
Sounds good.

678
00:26:34,319 --> 00:26:34,599
Let's go.

679
00:26:36,240 --> 00:26:36,720
Jiayin.

680
00:26:37,039 --> 00:26:38,880
Why don't you leave your contact info?

681
00:26:46,319 --> 00:26:46,799
Excuse me, miss.

682
00:26:47,359 --> 00:26:48,559
That foreigner inside,

683
00:26:49,200 --> 00:26:50,400
is he a model here?

684
00:26:50,839 --> 00:26:51,960
He's our client.

685
00:26:53,319 --> 00:26:55,079
Your business has expanded overseas?

686
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:56,039
You bet!

687
00:26:56,519 --> 00:26:58,039
He's a major client.

688
00:26:58,160 --> 00:26:59,640
His sales overseas are huge.

689
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:01,839
He orders hundreds of sets every single time.

690
00:27:02,200 --> 00:27:02,680
Is that so?

691
00:27:08,400 --> 00:27:09,240
That's really impressive.

692
00:27:10,720 --> 00:27:12,319
All that overtime wasn't for nothing.

693
00:27:12,759 --> 00:27:13,440
After so long,

694
00:27:13,440 --> 00:27:14,359
it finally paid off.

695
00:27:15,079 --> 00:27:15,799
Glad we pulled it off.

696
00:27:15,799 --> 00:27:16,440
Yes, looks good.

697
00:27:16,440 --> 00:27:17,240
No problem. Let's do that.

698
00:27:18,839 --> 00:27:19,119
Zhou.

699
00:27:19,599 --> 00:27:20,039
Sorry to bother you.

700
00:27:20,039 --> 00:27:20,440
No worries.

701
00:27:22,119 --> 00:27:23,519
Why don't we find a place at noon

702
00:27:23,839 --> 00:27:24,640
to grab a working lunch?

703
00:27:26,119 --> 00:27:27,240
Just say what's on your mind.

704
00:27:30,160 --> 00:27:30,880
I just wanted to

705
00:27:31,920 --> 00:27:32,599
ask around a bit.

706
00:27:32,799 --> 00:27:33,160
For instance,

707
00:27:33,960 --> 00:27:35,480
for Changfu Construction,

708
00:27:35,960 --> 00:27:37,960
that other half of the Phase 3 payment,

709
00:27:38,240 --> 00:27:39,880
roughly when can it be released?

710
00:27:40,519 --> 00:27:41,119
Not right now.

711
00:27:41,519 --> 00:27:42,960
During this acquisition process,

712
00:27:43,440 --> 00:27:44,519
all of Changfu's accounts

713
00:27:44,799 --> 00:27:45,519
must be frozen

714
00:27:45,920 --> 00:27:46,559
for auditing.

715
00:27:47,119 --> 00:27:47,799
That's the rule.

716
00:27:48,480 --> 00:27:49,680
Once the acquisition is completed

717
00:27:49,839 --> 00:27:51,079
and the new contracts are signed,

718
00:27:51,440 --> 00:27:52,079
the money owed

719
00:27:52,319 --> 00:27:52,880
will naturally be paid.

720
00:27:53,480 --> 00:27:53,880
Of course,

721
00:27:54,480 --> 00:27:55,440
the prerequisite for all this

722
00:27:55,640 --> 00:27:57,039
is that during the audit,

723
00:27:57,400 --> 00:27:58,480
everything checks out clean.

724
00:28:00,839 --> 00:28:01,759
If there's nothing else, I'll take off.

725
00:28:03,240 --> 00:28:04,039
Let's grab a meal sometime.

726
00:28:04,079 --> 00:28:04,359
Sure.

727
00:28:58,279 --> 00:29:00,359
Let's buy a computer.

728
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:01,799
Buy one? No way.

729
00:29:01,799 --> 00:29:02,759
Computers are so expensive!

730
00:29:04,200 --> 00:29:05,519
I just ran the numbers.

731
00:29:06,279 --> 00:29:08,440
Rent, labor, materials...

732
00:29:09,240 --> 00:29:10,119
It all costs money.

733
00:29:10,400 --> 00:29:13,319
Even if we make 500 wedding dresses a year,

734
00:29:14,039 --> 00:29:15,759
the net profit is barely over 80,000.

735
00:29:16,200 --> 00:29:17,880
And that's not even counting our wages.

736
00:29:18,400 --> 00:29:19,880
Even if neither of us takes a cut,

737
00:29:20,240 --> 00:29:21,279
after year-end dividends,

738
00:29:21,559 --> 00:29:22,640
we still have to cover next year's

739
00:29:22,799 --> 00:29:24,559
rent, labor, and materials.

740
00:29:24,839 --> 00:29:26,119
Just thinking about it gives me a headache.

741
00:29:26,720 --> 00:29:27,640
The money you need to spend

742
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:29,960
can come from next year's client payouts.

743
00:29:29,960 --> 00:29:30,680
Wouldn't that work?

744
00:29:31,160 --> 00:29:32,240
What if they don't pay?

745
00:29:33,240 --> 00:29:34,960
What if Peng doesn't give us any work?

746
00:29:34,960 --> 00:29:35,519
What do we do then?

747
00:29:36,799 --> 00:29:37,839
He wouldn't do that.

748
00:29:37,839 --> 00:29:38,880
Why wouldn't he?

749
00:29:39,440 --> 00:29:42,319
If only we could connect with that foreigner directly,

750
00:29:42,319 --> 00:29:43,160
that'd be great.

751
00:29:44,640 --> 00:29:46,480
You want to poach that foreigner?

752
00:29:46,599 --> 00:29:48,160
I just haven't figured out how yet,

753
00:29:48,160 --> 00:29:49,400
but we definitely have to do it.

754
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:55,200
Is your back hurting?

755
00:29:55,200 --> 00:29:56,240
I'm fine, just an old issue.

756
00:29:56,359 --> 00:29:57,160
I'll be fine once I move around.

757
00:29:58,359 --> 00:29:58,880
Xiaojing,

758
00:30:00,519 --> 00:30:01,759
help me gather the wedding dresses outside

759
00:30:01,759 --> 00:30:02,599
and bring them in.

760
00:30:02,799 --> 00:30:03,160
Sure thing!

761
00:30:13,319 --> 00:30:13,960
Sister-in-law,

762
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:15,720
I've got an idea.

763
00:30:16,279 --> 00:30:16,680
Come here.

764
00:30:18,839 --> 00:30:20,400
I'll apply for a job at Peng's company

765
00:30:20,559 --> 00:30:22,599
to see if I can get that foreigner's schedule,

766
00:30:22,839 --> 00:30:24,000
and try to get in touch with him.

767
00:30:24,960 --> 00:30:25,640
Can you pull that off?

768
00:30:26,079 --> 00:30:27,039
Doesn't matter if I can.

769
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:27,920
I have to make it work.

770
00:30:29,319 --> 00:30:29,880
Sure enough,

771
00:30:30,799 --> 00:30:32,640
no one named Sai is a pushover.

772
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:55,599
You're here.

773
00:30:56,400 --> 00:30:56,799
What's up?

774
00:30:57,000 --> 00:30:57,400
Make it quick.

775
00:31:03,039 --> 00:31:03,759
Wei,

776
00:31:04,880 --> 00:31:06,400
about you selling Changfu...

777
00:31:07,319 --> 00:31:07,680
I understand.

778
00:31:08,559 --> 00:31:11,240
But once you hand all this over,

779
00:31:13,480 --> 00:31:15,559
you've got to leave your old pal a way out.

780
00:31:16,960 --> 00:31:18,200
You run your company,

781
00:31:18,200 --> 00:31:19,119
and I sell mine.

782
00:31:19,119 --> 00:31:20,480
How is that not leaving you a way out?

783
00:31:20,480 --> 00:31:22,559
You know what I mean.

784
00:31:27,480 --> 00:31:28,680
Between our two companies,

785
00:31:29,519 --> 00:31:32,720
with all those contracts and dealings...

786
00:31:32,920 --> 00:31:34,759
Sure, there's nothing major,

787
00:31:34,960 --> 00:31:37,200
but there are always off-the-books expenses

788
00:31:37,359 --> 00:31:38,279
that need to be smoothed over.

789
00:31:38,519 --> 00:31:40,759
Shouldn't we work together on that?

790
00:31:41,279 --> 00:31:41,920
What's that supposed to mean?

791
00:31:45,160 --> 00:31:46,000
Now you come looking for me,

792
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:46,400
huh?

793
00:31:46,920 --> 00:31:49,200
That day when you threatened Shi Yongnian,

794
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:51,079
saying you'd sue Changfu Construction,

795
00:31:51,559 --> 00:31:53,359
why didn't you remember we were brothers?

796
00:31:53,880 --> 00:31:55,119
Didn't I tell you?

797
00:31:55,319 --> 00:31:57,200
That was just to scare Shi Yongnian.

798
00:31:57,200 --> 00:31:58,240
I had no choice!

799
00:31:58,240 --> 00:31:59,799
No choice, so you chose me to use as a pawn?

800
00:31:59,960 --> 00:32:00,960
Now that trouble's started,

801
00:32:01,119 --> 00:32:02,079
you come to me to clean up your mess?

802
00:32:02,319 --> 00:32:03,599
Do you take me for a fool?

803
00:32:03,839 --> 00:32:04,440
Wei,

804
00:32:05,039 --> 00:32:07,279
aren't you trying to sell Changfu?

805
00:32:07,559 --> 00:32:09,720
If they dig up any problems,

806
00:32:09,799 --> 00:32:11,480
think you can still get a good price?

807
00:32:11,640 --> 00:32:13,400
When that happens, even if I don't look for you,

808
00:32:13,680 --> 00:32:15,079
you'll come looking for me.

809
00:32:15,359 --> 00:32:17,200
So what if I get a little less?

810
00:32:17,680 --> 00:32:19,279
My kids are all grown up.

811
00:32:19,279 --> 00:32:20,119
They don't need my support.

812
00:32:20,640 --> 00:32:22,359
I barely spend anything myself anyway.

813
00:32:23,759 --> 00:32:25,119
Let's not talk in anger.

814
00:32:25,559 --> 00:32:26,920
Who turns down money?

815
00:32:28,039 --> 00:32:29,920
You took your fair share of it too.

816
00:32:31,240 --> 00:32:31,680
What did you say?

817
00:32:33,079 --> 00:32:33,759
Say that again!

818
00:32:33,759 --> 00:32:35,119
Am I lying?

819
00:32:35,480 --> 00:32:36,920
Inflating prices, dragging out schedules...

820
00:32:37,359 --> 00:32:39,000
wasn't that so you could pocket some extra?

821
00:32:39,279 --> 00:32:40,200
Then again,

822
00:32:40,559 --> 00:32:42,559
that was your idea in the first place.

823
00:32:43,240 --> 00:32:45,079
I wasn't the only one who profited.

824
00:32:45,079 --> 00:32:45,640
Sai Duoxi,

825
00:32:46,039 --> 00:32:47,559
that's pretty low of you.

826
00:32:48,559 --> 00:32:49,799
If I hadn't covered for you,

827
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:51,240
could you have gotten all those jobs?

828
00:32:51,240 --> 00:32:51,680
Sure,

829
00:32:52,200 --> 00:32:53,200
you covered for me.

830
00:32:53,640 --> 00:32:55,200
But I put my neck on the line for you too!

831
00:32:55,319 --> 00:32:56,400
Neither of us owes the other a thing!

832
00:33:05,039 --> 00:33:05,359
Wei,

833
00:33:05,920 --> 00:33:06,799
what happened this time...

834
00:33:06,960 --> 00:33:08,599
yeah, I was out of line.

835
00:33:09,000 --> 00:33:10,319
Let's not settle old scores right now,

836
00:33:10,319 --> 00:33:10,839
okay?

837
00:33:11,279 --> 00:33:11,960
Let's focus on this:

838
00:33:12,680 --> 00:33:15,480
what if Shi Yongnian finds something?

839
00:33:15,839 --> 00:33:16,839
At best,

840
00:33:17,799 --> 00:33:19,599
your company won't fetch a good price.

841
00:33:20,319 --> 00:33:21,799
What if he blows it out of proportion,

842
00:33:22,200 --> 00:33:22,920
seizes on it,

843
00:33:22,920 --> 00:33:23,720
and comes after us?

844
00:33:28,400 --> 00:33:29,039
This...

845
00:33:29,559 --> 00:33:31,160
is our last deal together.

846
00:33:31,920 --> 00:33:32,799
Once it's done,

847
00:33:34,759 --> 00:33:35,920
you sell Changfu and retire,

848
00:33:37,400 --> 00:33:38,440
and Ma and I

849
00:33:40,200 --> 00:33:41,640
will keep running our company.

850
00:33:42,920 --> 00:33:45,400
So we have to get the books in order,

851
00:33:45,720 --> 00:33:47,680
touch up the contracts,

852
00:33:47,920 --> 00:33:48,880
and have Qingyou

853
00:33:49,240 --> 00:33:50,279
audit everything thoroughly.

854
00:33:50,559 --> 00:33:52,119
That way, everyone passes scrutiny.

855
00:33:55,720 --> 00:33:56,119
And then?

856
00:33:57,720 --> 00:33:58,319
What happens next?

857
