1140
00:42:46,679 --> 00:42:47,920
Once we get past this hurdle,

1141
00:42:50,199 --> 00:42:51,599
I'll run my company,

1142
00:42:52,599 --> 00:42:54,360
and you can keep running your law firm.

1143
00:42:55,559 --> 00:42:56,760
I won't stand in your way anymore.

1144
00:42:57,599 --> 00:42:58,760
Dad, have you ever stopped to think?

1145
00:42:58,760 --> 00:42:59,519
If you do this,

1146
00:42:59,519 --> 00:43:02,039
we'll never get through this!

1147
00:43:02,039 --> 00:43:03,039
So what, you just want

1148
00:43:03,039 --> 00:43:05,280
to watch our family fall apart completely

1149
00:43:05,360 --> 00:43:06,280
before you're satisfied?

1150
00:43:06,280 --> 00:43:06,800
Is that it?

1151
00:43:06,800 --> 00:43:07,719
No, Dad, can we please just calm down?

1152
00:43:07,719 --> 00:43:08,880
Enough! Get the hell out!

1153
00:43:09,239 --> 00:43:09,559
Get out!

1154
00:43:20,159 --> 00:43:21,039
When I went to the site today,

1155
00:43:22,639 --> 00:43:24,159
I saw Eldest Brother and Ma Laijiao.

1156
00:43:25,360 --> 00:43:25,880
The two of them...

1157
00:43:26,079 --> 00:43:26,679
What about them?

1158
00:43:27,039 --> 00:43:28,159
They were hugging.

1159
00:43:28,960 --> 00:43:30,000
If you're having trouble,

1160
00:43:30,719 --> 00:43:31,960
just tell Dad directly.

1161
00:43:32,000 --> 00:43:33,039
Well, if I tell you,

1162
00:43:33,880 --> 00:43:35,079
you can't get mad.

1163
00:43:35,199 --> 00:43:37,079
I really couldn't find a job,

1164
00:43:37,199 --> 00:43:39,880
so I opened a bridal shop with Sister-in-law.

1165
00:43:40,719 --> 00:43:41,880
That 50,000 yuan...

1166
00:43:42,639 --> 00:43:43,519
I gave it all to her.
